[42.4252, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m● belay\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[42.4254, "o", "  Ha, no wonder Cloudtunes slipped through — easy to lose track of these. One more thing the data caught:\r\n\r\n  **Annual car insurance** — €420, always in July, seen both years in your history (2024 and 2025).\r\n\r\n  Two questions:\r\n  1. Confirm that one as-is for the yearly bank?\r\n  2. Anything else non-monthly (insurance, memberships, taxes, gifts) that wouldn't show up as a clean recurring pattern — since 24 months only catches things that repeat within that window?\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;36malex ▸ \u001b[0m"]
